menu "capture"

    config CAPTURE_DURATION_S
        int "Stream for this many seconds after the link comes up"
        range 10 3600
        default 1860
        help
            30 minutes plus a minute of margin, so a host session of 1800 s
            always ends before the board stops sending (E5-T12). Stays at or
            under SVC_REPORT_STREAM_MAX_S.

    config CAPTURE_PCM_SHIFT_FALLBACK
        int "Microphone right shift until calib/pcm_shift is measured"
        range 8 16
        default 16
        help
            Same meaning as APP_PCM_SHIFT_FALLBACK of main: drv_audio keeps the
            top 32 - shift bits of each INMP441 slot. NVS calib/pcm_shift wins.

    config CAPTURE_REF_ENABLE
        bool "MAX98357A fitted: capture the speaker reference too, as mode 3"
        default n
        help
            Board B has no speaker, so it captures ch0 ch1 in mode 2 (KEHOACH 7.4).

endmenu
